	<description><![CDATA[Standalone building loop, generated by scripts/gen_building_loop.py. Plan view 180 m -> spiral -> 1.2 turns -> eye level 31 m at radius 60 m. Altitudes derive from this building's extrusion height (21.0 m), so a corrected height re-cuts the shot. Load alongside geometry.kml.]]></description>
